    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Rotate the hexagons to fit the pieces together</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1550920/extras/400da8d66f32018c61acd35551fa29f9.poster.avif?t=1750547840\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1550920/extras/400da8d66f32018c61acd35551fa29f9.webm?t=1750547840\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1550920/extras/400da8d66f32018c61acd35551fa29f9.mp4?t=1750547840\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Go through challenges. Create slimes.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1550920/extras/66214990654182f630ccea3354b73d48.poster.avif?t=1750547840\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1550920/extras/66214990654182f630ccea3354b73d48.webm?t=1750547840\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1550920/extras/66214990654182f630ccea3354b73d48.mp4?t=1750547840\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Slime Alchemy is a relaxing puzzle game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Featuring:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Move pieces on a <strong>hexagonal grid</strong>, fitting them into patterns to solve the puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> There are <strong>50 challenging levels</strong> to complete.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Engaging and <strong>relaxing</strong> soundtrack. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Fully <strong>replayable</strong> (pieces are shuffled <strong>randomly</strong> with each new playthrough). </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Hand-drawn</strong> graphics.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you ready to solve the <strong>puzzles</strong> and create <strong>slimes</strong>?</p>",
